#: geosight/data/models/context_layer.py:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The type of layer for this context layer.<br>For <b>ArcGIS</b>, put feature "
"server of REST. e.g : https://{host}/rest/services/{layer}/FeatureServer/1."
"<br>For <b>GeoJson</b>, put url of geojson.<br>For <b>Raster tile</b>, put "
"XYZ url.<br>For <b>Raster COG</b>, put url of cog.<br>For <b>Related table</"
"b>, select existing related table name.<br>For <b>Vector tile</b>, put XYZ "
"url.<br>For <b>Cloud native gis layer</b>, select the layer from cloud "
"native gis."
msgstr ""
"Le type de couche pour cette couche de contexte.<br>Pour <b>ArcGIS</b>, "
"indiquez le Feature Server REST, p. ex. : https://{host}/rest/services/"
"{layer}/FeatureServer/1.<br>Pour <b>GeoJson</b>, indiquez l'URL du GeoJSON."
"<br>Pour <b>Raster tile</b>, indiquez l'URL XYZ.<br>Pour <b>Raster COG</b>, "
"indiquez l'URL du COG.<br>Pour <b>Related table</b>, sélectionnez le nom "
"d'une table associée existante.<br>Pour <b>Vector tile</b>, indiquez l'URL "
"XYZ.<br>Pour <b>Cloud native gis layer</b>, sélectionnez la couche dans "
"cloud native gis."

